#//// Neoffice — commit-the-build: upstream ignores every generated asset
#//// below; we track them instead, because our instances pull the built app
#//// and never run `yarn build` (4 GB RAM = OOM). Un-ignoring them here is the
#//// whole mechanism — do not "clean up" these commented lines.
# CLAUDE.md  # 2026-05-07 unshipped to document commit-the-build pipeline
# 2026-05-07 (NORA #28) — frontend build outputs are committed on this branch.
# See docs/COMMIT-BUILD-PATTERN.md in neoffice-devops.
# Instances pull the built artifacts and never run `yarn build`, so every
# generated asset below stays tracked (upstream ignores them all).
# wiki/public/frontend/
# wiki/www/wiki-app.html
# wiki/public/css/tailwind.css
# wiki/public/css/frappe-ui-tokens.css
# wiki/public/css/frappe-ui-prose.css
# wiki/public/css/frappe-ui-code.css
# wiki/public/js/wiki-highlight.bundle.js
playwright-report/
test-results/
e2e/.auth/
.env
screenshots/

